      "message": "You are absolutely right, I was thinking about Val \u003d []byte{0,0,0,0}.  Changing and removing optionsTupleEmptyValue.\n\nIs it OK if I add a short test for marshaling a tuple with an empty value:\n\nfunc TestMarshalEmptyTuple(t *testing.T) {\n\ts :\u003d optionsTuple{Key: \"foo\"}\n\twant :\u003d []byte{0, 0, 0, 3, 102, 111, 111, 0, 0, 0, 0}\n\tb :\u003d Marshal(\u0026s)\n\tif bytes.Compare(b, want) !\u003d 0 {\n\t\tt.Errorf(\"got %b want %b\", b, want)\n\t}\n}",
